      "source": "By default, no language is configured. To configure them, go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Language & Region__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Content languages__TRILIUM_PH_5__, or select the __TRILIUM_PH_6__Configure languages...__TRILIUM_PH_7__ item when setting the language. The enabled languages are listed by their native names, sorted alphabetically, which is also the order the language selector shows them in. Here you can:",
